WEBVTT

00:08:59.530 --> 00:09:02.097
to use the digital platforms

00:09:02.130 --> 00:09:06.330
that all of us use every day
without even thinking, right?

00:09:06.930 --> 00:09:08.163
But ...

00:09:08.863 --> 00:09:11.297
Here is a large

00:09:11.330 --> 00:09:15.463
literate population
that wants to work, right,

00:09:15.497 --> 00:09:18.263
and how can we make this
possible for them?

00:09:18.297 --> 00:09:21.797
So Karya is one such way

00:09:21.830 --> 00:09:25.863
through which this population
can get on to the digital world

00:09:25.863 --> 00:09:27.297
and, you know,

00:09:27.330 --> 00:09:31.763
through that find work and do tasks
that can then earn them money.